{"id":"sguardo","lemma":"sguardo","pos":"noun","rank":1154,"glosses":["glance, look (action of looking)","look, expression","view"],"ipa":"/ˈzɡwar.do/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"sguardi"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-sguardo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Mi faccia dare uno sguardo.","en":"Let me take a gander.","words":[{"g":"me / myself"},{"g":"face"},{"g":"to give"},{"g":"a / one"},null]},{"text":"Il suo sguardo dice che ti ama.","en":"Her look says that she loves you.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"his, hers, its"},null,{"g":"to utter with one's…","l":"dire"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to love, to like","l":"amare"}]},{"text":"Si scambiarono uno sguardo.","en":"They exchanged a look.","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to exchange","l":"scambiare"},{"g":"a / one"},null]},{"text":"Se gli sguardi potessero uccidere io sarei già morto.","en":"If looks could kill, I'd be dead by now.","words":[{"g":"if"},{"g":"the / to him"},null,{"g":"can, could","l":"potere"},{"g":"to kill"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},{"g":"already"},{"g":"dead man"}]},{"text":"Aveva uno sguardo assente sul suo volto.","en":"He had an absent look on his face.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"avere"},{"g":"a / one"},null,{"g":"absent , away"},null,{"g":"his, hers, its"},{"g":"facing"}]}]}